# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Build context exclusions
#
# The vendored PaddleOCR clone is by far the largest thing in this repo and is
# never imported — the app uses the pip-installed `paddleocr` package, and the
# only mention of that directory is inside an error message. Sending it to the
# daemon added gigabytes to every build for nothing.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

danish betting/betting_detector/PaddleOCR/

# ── VCS / tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.gitignore
.github/
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/

# ── Python bytecode & envs ────────────────────────────────────
#
# Every pattern here is anchored with `**/`. A bare `.venv/` matches only a
# directory at the context root — it does NOT match at depth — and each of the
# three sub-projects carries its own committed virtualenv:
#
#     danish betting/betting_detector/.venv        1903 MB
#     scam-detector-capstone/.venv                 1144 MB
#     scam-detector-capstone/backend/venv          1144 MB
#     deepfake detection/deepfake-detection/.venv   863 MB
#
# Without the `**/` these shipped to the daemon on every build: a 4 GB context
# that took 38 minutes to transfer, to send Windows virtualenvs that a Linux
# image cannot use.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/htmlcov/
**/.coverage
**/node_modules/

# ── Secrets: never bake these into an image layer ─────────────
**/.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# ── Runtime state — supplied by volumes, not the image ────────
# Baking a database in would ship one deployment's users and scan history to
# every other deployment. There are databases outside the context root
# ('fake customer carer/shield.db', the betting detector's two), so these are
# `**/`-anchored like the virtualenv patterns above.
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
static/uploads/
**/logs/
**/*.log

# ── Docs, reports and scratch work — not needed at runtime ────
md/
scratch/
evaluation/
**/*.pdf
**/~$*
project_report.html
README.md
LICENSE

# ── Training scripts & datasets ───────────────────────────────
danish betting/betting_detector/datasets/
danish betting/betting_detector/tests/
danish betting/betting_detector/dashboard/
deepfake detection/deepfake-detection/dataset_split/
scam-detector-capstone/backend/
scam-detector-capstone/test_*.py
**/*.pkl.bak

# ── Docker's own files ────────────────────────────────────────
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml
